  "AI as tool, delegate, collaborator, or future subject": "IA herramienta jinaki, apoderado jinaki, yanapiri jinaki, jan ukax jutïri jaqi jinaki",
  "AI content payment is not merely a copyright or transaction-efficiency problem; it is a question of political-economic legitimacy. As AI valuations reach hundreds of billions, society asks why the gains from public web content and human knowledge accrue to a few firms. The paper proposes a six-layer tiered data market — from free public content through scarce verified datasets to public benefit-sharing — and defines the AI network democratic economy: rights, pricing, participation, auditability, and returns, each democratized through machine-readable protocols like AICR/AICL.": "IA contenido pagox janiw ukhamäkiti mä derecho autor jan ukax transacción eficiencia jan waltʼawi jinaki; política-económica legitimidad jisktʼawiwa. IA valoranakax waranqa waranqa millonanakaru puriski ukhaxa, marka jisktʼasi: kunatsa taqi jaqin internet contenidopat ukat jaqin yatiñapat mistuki askinakax pisi empresanakaru puri sasa. Qillqatax suxta capa utjiri mercado datu, patamp jaljata amta churi — jan pagat taqi jaqin contenidotpach, pisi ukat comprobata datunakan taypitpach, taqi jaqin askipa apthapiñkama — ukat IA red democrático economía qhanañchi: derechonaka, chanïnchawi, mayampi mantasiña, auditoría lurasiña, ukat kutt'ayawi, sapa amtax makinanakan ullañapataki protocolonakampi kunjamtï AICR/AICL ukhamampi democratizatawa.",
