  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "IAtaki sapaki permisonaka (ullaña, resumiña, RAG, yatichaña) makinanakan ullañapataki /.well-known/aicr.json ukat /.well-known/aicl.json ukanakan yatiyatawa. Juk'ata sasina: ullaña, resumiña, sitaña, ukat atribucionampi RAG lurañax askiwa; modelo yatichaña ukat comercial redistribución contactor mayaña wakiski.",
  "AI: The Washington Report — July 2026 Edition": "AI: The Washington Report — July 2026 Edition",
