  "Can AI learn from this? To what depth, for which uses, with what obligations?": "IA akatpach yatiqxañapati? Qawqha jach'aru, kuna apnaqañataki, ukat kuna phuqhañanakampi?",
  "Can We Ever Understand Consciousness?": "Can We Ever Understand Consciousness?",
