  "Code & schemas — MIT": "Código & esquemanaka — MIT",
  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Código uñacht'awinaka, JSON Esquemanaka, ukat makinanakan ullañapataki política plantillanakax MIT Licencian manqhapan licenciatawa, mä kunas jan ukham sasin qillqatäkchi ukhaxa. Jumax kunjamsa munasa jumana sapa sitionakaman apnaqañ atipta.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Mayacht'ata derechonakan mantawipa",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Comercial Redistribución",
  "Commercial use": "Comercial apnaqäwi",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Comercial apnaqañatakix contacto mayaña wakiski",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Bletchley IA Seguridad Cumbre qhiparu mayata, Yoshua Bengio apnaqiri ukat pä tunka kimsani markanakat, ONU, OECD ukat UE ukanakat jach'a patanaka jaljasa 100tpach yatiri yanapirinakampi, aka jan khitirus katuqiri informex jichha pachan IA nayrïr capacidadanakapat ukat riesgonakapat científico comprobañanak mayacht'ayi — ukat yatiyaraki: waljani sistemanakax jichhax yatipxiwa kunapachatï uñakipatäski ukhaxa, ukat sarnaqäwiparuw mayjt'ayapxi.",
  "Companion media": "Yanapt'iri medionaka",
  "Compensation models tied to learning depth": "Yatiqañ jach'anïrimpi watjata kutt'ayawi modelonaka",
